[00:00.16]You don't have to leap mountains to make progress sometimes.|有时候，想要取得进步，你不必去跨越什么高山。
[00:03.46]The smallest steps are the ones that take you the farthest.|最小的步子，反而能带你走得最远。
[00:06.26]Many people give up on their dreams because they look at the whole journey and feel overwhelmed,|很多人放弃梦想，是因为盯着整段旅程看，觉得不堪重负，
[00:11.20]forgetting that every great achievement is built on tiny, consistent actions.|却忘了每一项了不起的成就，都是靠微小而持续的行动堆起来的。
[00:15.88]You might not see change tomorrow or even next week, but if you keep showing up,|也许明天、甚至下周你都看不到变化，但只要你持续出现，
[00:20.92]keep doing the little things that matter, you'll wake up one day and realize you've come further than you ever imagined.|一直做那些真正重要的小事，总有一天你会醒来时发现，自己走得比想象中远得多。
[00:26.70]It's not about being perfect. It's about being persistent.|关键不在于完美，而在于坚持。
[00:30.00]Every time you choose to keep going instead of quitting, you're building strength, resilience, and the confidence to keep chasing what matters to you.|每一次你选择继续而不是放弃，你都在积累力量、韧劲，以及继续追逐所爱的信心。
[00:38.62]Don't underestimate the power of a single step.|不要低估一步的力量。
[00:41.42]Today's small effort is tomorrow's big success.|今天的小小努力，就是明天的大成功。
